          &lt;div&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.gigeconomydata.org/taxonomy/term/15" hreflang="en"&gt;independent contractors&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
          &lt;div&gt;&lt;a href="https://www.gigeconomydata.org/taxonomy/term/11" hreflang="en"&gt;online platforms&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
